{"id":"n67230-1-8","stage":5,"title":"엄살 · 装样","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67230-1-8-1","ko":"아파서 죽을 것 같아요.","zh":"我疼得要死了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아파서","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아파서","audio":"/audio/1d188c109f3d5cabce14.mp3"}},{"text":"죽을","meaning":"表示前面所指的状态或感觉等程度非常严重。","explanation":"죽다：表示前面所指的状态或感觉等程度非常严重；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"죽다","audio":"/audio/66bd3b1f27c0ee2e97b7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77246","senseId":"1","lemma":"죽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"죽을","audio":"/audio/c0a424b418e8a964720b.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아요.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아요","audio":"/audio/d27f58354e12c6dc5616.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]},{"id":"66bd3b1f27c0ee2e","term":"죽다","zh":"表示前面所指的状态或感觉等程度非常严重。","audio":"/audio/66bd3b1f27c0ee2e97b7.mp3","entryId":"77246","definition":"表示前面所指的状态或感觉等程度非常严重。","pronunciation":["죽따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/1d278cb705c81cff3fe2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67230-1-8-2","ko":"겨우 주사 맞는 것 가지고 엄살 부리지 마.","zh":"就打一针而已，别这么小题大做。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"겨우","meaning":"只有，才，仅仅","explanation":"겨우：只有，才，仅仅。","readings":[{"term":"겨우","audio":"/audio/880de41d778f7e2c5cf5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62262","senseId":"2","lemma":"겨우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"겨우","audio":"/audio/880de41d778f7e2c5cf5.mp3"}},{"text":"주사","meaning":"注射","explanation":"주사：注射。","readings":[{"term":"주사","audio":"/audio/32b004ef02722e1be5d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91770","senseId":"1","lemma":"주사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주사","audio":"/audio/32b004ef02722e1be5d8.mp3"}},{"text":"맞는","meaning":"是","explanation":"맞다：是；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"4","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞는","audio":"/audio/7c4aa2dc115d70f0d253.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"가지고","meaning":"拿，就","explanation":"가지다：拿，就；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"가지다","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65234","senseId":"10","lemma":"가지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가지고","audio":"/audio/2e847f33430d128ed48a.mp3"}},{"text":"엄살","meaning":"装样，装疼","explanation":"엄살：装样，装疼。","readings":[{"term":"엄살","audio":"/audio/06f2a9a8c90d036a0949.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67230","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄살","audio":"/audio/06f2a9a8c90d036a0949.mp3"}},{"text":"부리지","meaning":"耍，起，犯，闹","explanation":"부리다：耍，起，犯，闹；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"부리다","audio":"/audio/1ae5473e59c47bdc447f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59689","senseId":"2","lemma":"부리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부리지","audio":"/audio/fef0967312ad30e67fc8.mp3"}},{"text":"마.","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마","audio":"/audio/0a8a81fee098641dbae5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"880de41d778f7e2c","term":"겨우","zh":"只有，才，仅仅","audio":"/audio/880de41d778f7e2c5cf5.mp3","entryId":"62262","definition":"全算上也只不过。","pronunciation":["겨우"]},{"id":"32b004ef02722e1b","term":"주사","zh":"注射","audio":"/audio/32b004ef02722e1be5d8.mp3","entryId":"91770","definition":"用注射器直接往人或动物体内注射药液。","pronunciation":["주ː사"]},{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"是","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"某物是某人的而没有差错。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"f3b684d86e5485ed","term":"가지다","zh":"拿，就","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3","entryId":"65234","definition":"把某物或人当作对象。","pronunciation":["가지다"]},{"id":"06f2a9a8c90d036a","term":"엄살","zh":"装样，装疼","audio":"/audio/06f2a9a8c90d036a0949.mp3","entryId":"67230","definition":"假装疼痛、痛苦，或比实际表现得夸张；或指那样的态度或言语。","pronunciation":["엄살"]},{"id":"1ae5473e59c47bdc","